===Etymology===
From {{m|ja|おもき|tr=omoki}}, the {{m|ja|連体形|tr=rentaikei|t=attributive form}} of {{inh|ja|ja-mid-ear|-}} adjective {{m|ja|重し|tr=omoshi}}, with the medial {{IPAfont|/-k-/}} falling out; eventually from {{inh|ja|jpx-pro|*onpo|sort=おもい}}.

